  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4802.15 Terminal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4802.15 “Terminal” means a reportable fuel and distribution facility that is supplied by pipeline or vessel and from which reportable fuel may be removed at a rack. The term includes bulk plants that store reportable fuel for others.\n\nSource. #10022, eff 11-9-11; ss by #13039, eff 4-20-20 (formerly Saf-C 4802.14)",
